  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello VrChat team & community!\n\nI had wished that at the time there was an easier way to be notified that someone has declined a request whether on the VRchat website or in the interactive menus. Because as a new user at the time I had no idea on how requests worked. Would there be a way to implement a notification in-game or on the website saying “this user is not currently accepting requests” or “this user has kindly declined your request”? As a person with adhd it is difficult to pick up on social cues so having an accessibility option would seriously help.\n\nFor the specifics of the notification system after a request has been declined have options for\n\n \n\n- send notification automatically\n\n- send notification when the user who sent the request is not in the same instance as the user\n\ntime options -\n\nsend notification: immediately - 30 min later - 2 hrs later - 8 hrs later - 24 hrs later \n\nThank you for your time - Shards001",
